  "_file": "damned_waters/game/data/rooms/hotel_bar.json \u2014 RoomSpec for Hotel de IJ \u00b7 Bar (the city, district 6: Damrak): the bar of a hotel on Damrak: the long counter, the bottles lit along the back, stools, the booths by the window, a chandelier; glasses still on the tables. The night porter kept a gun behind the bar. It's gone. Its front wall is the street's shopfront (\"facade\": the street builds it); its door is the street's. Every business name is made up. Single source of truth for Blender (render) and the engine (collision, cameras, things).",
